# What this file does: excludes local, regenerable, and build-output directories from the Docker
# build context for `apps/web/Dockerfile`.
# Used here and why: `node_modules`/`.svelte-kit`/`build` are regenerated inside the image by
# `pnpm install`/`pnpm build`, so shipping the host's copies would be wasted context transfer and
# could leak a host-specific (non-Linux) `node_modules`; `test-results`/`playwright-report` are
# Playwright's local e2e output, irrelevant to the image.
# How it fits the project: keeps `docker build`'s context small and reproducible for the `web`
# service image (ADR-0005 deployment).
# Used by: `docker build -f apps/web/Dockerfile`, `docker compose build web`.
node_modules
.svelte-kit
build
test-results
playwright-report
